  "sourceText": "Cuke Salad\nBy: Anonymous\nPublished: Monday, November 30, 2009 - 11:52pm\n\nIngredients\n\n\n\n\n1 med. unpeeled cucumber, diced\n1 sm. onion, chopped\n1/2 cup chopped celery\n1 pkg. lemon Jello\n1/2 cup boiling water\n1 tablespoon vinegar\n1/2 cup low fat mayonnaise\n1 pound low fat cottage cheese\n1/2 cup chopped walnuts\n1 sm. can unsweetened pineapple bits, including juice\n\nPreparation\n\n1 Dissolve Jello in hot water, add vinegar and remaining ingredients. Set in refrigerator until firm.",
